    "bbox": [
      58.58,
      480.31,
      554.76,
      591.91
    ],
    "text": "Issued at 05.30 a.m. on 14 September 2026. Due to a low-level atmospheric disturbance in the vicinity of Sri Lanka, cloudy skies are expected over the Western, Central, Sabaragamuwa, Southern and Uva provinces, with showers or thundershowers occurring at times. Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places in other parts of the Island after 1.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
